<div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div><a class="upload-image ui-draggable" href="#"><img width="100%" height="" class="img-responsive" alt="" src="/uploads/images/843687b73f4ea76b01116ccb27d9679a.jpg"></a></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div> <div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; Q :316不鏽鋼使用原因</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; A :使用原因很簡單,因為它是最佳的抗腐蝕材料,316不鏽鋼的價錢真的很高,但為了創造更好的釣魚環境跟體驗我們不計成本的使用</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; Q :如何分辨是不是316不銹鋼</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp; A :很多人都會說316,304但到底差別在哪?其實分辨辦法很簡單只要一塊磁鐵就好!<span style="font-weight: bold;"> 316是完全吸不起來的<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold;"><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="placeholder-container active"><div class="placeholder"><div class="placeholder-content col-md-12 ui-droppable"><div class="summber-note-panel" style="display: block;"><p><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," data-filename="WEFOX 超強316白鐵線1.jpg" style="width: 500px; height: 114.711px;"><br></p></div></div></div><div class="placeholder-handle"><div class="handle-move"><i class="fa fa-bars"></i></div><div class="handle-remove"><i class="fa fa-times"></i></div><